@startuml SD_UC_E3_Settle_Invoice
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14

actor "Nhân viên Phục vụ" as Waitstaff
boundary "Giao diện Web" as UI
control "InvoiceController" as Controller
participant "InvoiceService" as Service
participant "InvoiceRepository" as Repo
database "SQL Server" as DB
participant "Printer" as Printer

== Kịch bản 1: Xem tạm tính (kèm mã VietQR ngân hàng) ==

Waitstaff -> UI: Chọn bàn & Xem tạm tính
activate UI

UI -> Controller: GET /api/invoices/\npreview/{tableId}
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: CalculateInvoice(tableId)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: GetOrderAndDeposit(tableId)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: SELECT ServedItems & Deposit
activate DB
DB --> Repo: RawData
deactivate DB
Repo --> Service: Data
deactivate Repo

Service -> Service: Calculate & GenerateVietQR(Data)

Service --> Controller: InvoicePreviewDto (Amount, VietQR)
deactivate Service

Controller --> UI: 200 OK
deactivate Controller

UI --> Waitstaff: Hiển thị tạm tính & mã VietQR
deactivate UI

== Kịch bản 2: Xác nhận thanh toán (Tiền mặt / Chuyển khoản / Card) ==

Waitstaff -> UI: Chọn (Cash/Transfer/Card) & Xác nhận
activate UI

UI -> Controller: POST /api/invoices/{tableId}/settle
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: SettleInvoice(dto)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: SaveInvoice & SetTableCleaning(dto)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: INSERT Invoices, UPDATE Orders & Tables
activate DB
DB --> Repo: OK
deactivate DB
Repo --> Service: Saved
deactivate Repo

Service -> Printer: PrintReceipt(invoice)
activate Printer
Printer --> Service: OK
deactivate Printer

Service -> UI: PushSignalR("Table_Cleaning")

Service --> Controller: Result(Success)
deactivate Service

Controller --> UI: 200 OK
deactivate Controller

UI --> Waitstaff: Thanh toán thành công
deactivate UI

@enduml